Built-in skills of the chats
=============================

The skills "docx", "xlsx", "pptx" and "pdf" are adapted from the skills of the
Feather project.

  Source:  https://github.com/paper-instruments/feather-train
           (folder feather-harness/src/feather_harness/skills)
  Commit:  b7463092af862ebbdf4c5920c4bc9ab38ab17ad9
  Licence: MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Paper Instruments, Inc.

What was changed: the text about LibreOffice was replaced by a note that
LibreOffice is not installed, the text about OCR was shortened in the same way,
and the generated page of the LibreOffice-backed module "openpyxl.oracle" got
the same note. The skills "writing-skills" and "localai-workspace" were written
for the chats.

