The generated API pages
-----------------------

The pages under docx/references/api, xlsx/references/api and
pptx/references/api are generated from the docstrings of the Paper libraries
and of the libraries that they extend. The licences of those projects apply to
that text. All three are MIT licences.

paper-docx extends python-docx, and paper-pptx extends python-pptx. Steve Canny
wrote both upstream libraries, so the two licence files of the Paper packages
have the same text. Each applies to its own package.

  paper-docx   https://pypi.org/project/paper-docx/   (python-docx)
  paper-pptx   https://pypi.org/project/paper-pptx/   (python-pptx)

